        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Provider protocol tests&#10;&#10;Exact before / after run checks&#10;Strict empty and expiry lists&#10;Reject live / rerun / usable output&#10;No mutation or download requests" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
